## Advanced: Scripting Validation

For mods with complex scripts, the validator checks for Enforce Script restrictions.

**Forbidden in DayZ Enforce Script:**

```enforce_script
// ✗ FORBIDDEN: Ternary operator
int x = condition ? 1 : 0;

// ✓ CORRECT: Use if-else
int x;
if (condition) x = 1;
else x = 0;

// ✗ FORBIDDEN: Pre/post-increment
i++;
++i;

// ✓ CORRECT: Use += 1
i += 1;

// ✗ FORBIDDEN: foreach loops
foreach (int idx, string val in array) { }

// ✓ CORRECT: Use for loop
for (int i = 0; i < array.Count(); i++) { }

// ✗ FORBIDDEN: += with arrays
selections += "newSelection";

// ✓ CORRECT: Use .Insert()
selections.Insert("newSelection");
```

The validator will flag these automatically and suggest fixes.

